@startuml State_Stock_Opname
title State Machine — Stock Opname Session (SM-04, D-B09 Open)

' OBJECT  : SMO-04 Stock Opname Session
' UC      : UC-21 Buka sesi dan snapshot; UC-22 Hitung fisik dan selisih; UC-23 Post penyesuaian
' FR      : FR-OPN-001, FR-OPN-002, FR-OPN-003, FR-OPN-004, FR-OPN-005, FR-OPN-006, FR-AUD-004, FR-AUD-001
' RULE    : RULE-004, RULE-005, RULE-018, RULE-021, RULE-022, RULE-023, RULE-027
' DECISION: D-B09 Open, D-T06 Proposed
' CATATAN : Tidak ada state Locked, Approved, atau Completed. RULE-023 belum disetujui.

state "Draft" as Draft
state "Posted" as Posted

[*] --> Draft : Open [UC-21, lokasi aktif] / buat sesi dan rekam snapshot sistem

Draft --> Draft : Input [UC-22, kuantitas valid] / simpan hitung fisik, variance sama dengan fisik dikurangi snapshot

Draft --> Draft : Ajukan [UC-23, alasan diisi dan Inventory Admin] / siapkan penyesuaian

Draft --> Draft : Ditolak [tanpa alasan atau bukan Inventory Admin] / tolak, saldo tetap

Draft --> Posted : Post [UC-23, IA berwenang] / transaksi movement OPNAME_ADJUSTMENT, saldo mengikuti hasil fisik, audit, COMMIT

Draft --> Draft : Post gagal [error sebelum commit] / ROLLBACK penuh, saldo tidak parsial

Posted --> [*]

note right of Draft
  Snapshot stabil, FR-OPN-002.
  D-B09 Open: TIDAK ada location lock.
  State hanya Draft dan Posted.
end note

@enduml
